        Return the next value, or raise StopIteration.

        Examples
        --------
        >>> import numpy as np
        >>> x = np.ma.array([3, 2], mask=[0, 1])
        >>> fl = x.flat
        >>> next(fl)
        3
        >>> next(fl)
        masked
        >>> next(fl)
        Traceback (most recent call last):
          ...
        StopIteration

        rv␀␀)
